data: {"id": "1aceaabbf47d4c75-thinking-parallel_evidence-2646", "run_id": "1aceaabbf47d4c75", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实与根因判断\n\n**实体身份**\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v04/workload` (UID: `c4405668-4a40-44eb-9eed-a40f1a4ace4a`)\n- **状态**: `Pending` (Phase), `ContainerCreating` (Container Reason)\n- **节点**: `node2`\n- **容器**: `app`\n\n**根因证据 (支持)**\n1.  **直接原因**: Kubelet 事件明确报告 `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : secret \"unavailable-input\" not found`。\n2.  **配置验证**: Pod YAML 显示 Volume `input` 定义为 `Secret` 类型，引用的 `SecretName` 为 `unavailable-input`，且 `Optional: false`。\n3.  **阻塞表现**: 由于 Secret 缺失且非可选，Pod 无法完成初始化挂", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789119462138, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

